   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Dear Terrence;<br><div><br></div><div>I appreciate your valuable input, thank you! Just to make sure, the effect size I&#39;m trying to get the SE for is subtraction of two well-established within-group effect sizes (I&#39;m aware there are also alternatives). This effect size appears in Table 1 (last row), p. 114 of <a href=\"https://pdfs.semanticscholar.org/d88e/7804b7df89d229fd5db7a1c567b94ff18f33.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://pdfs.semanticscholar.org/d88e/7804b7df89d229fd5db7a1c567b94ff18f33.pdf&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792422446670000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2yl7Jn0NggZ1qRuKLELIrs\"><b>this article</b></a>.</div><div><br></div><div>But aside from that, can we define either my version or your suggested version in lavaan to get their SE?</div><div><br></div><div><div><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/attach/b3a0be08ecee0/image.png?part=0.1&amp;view=1\" alt=\"image.png\" width=\"687\" height=\"450\" style=\"margin-right:0px\"><br></div></div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Tue, Jan 28, 2020 at 3:18 AM Terrence Jorgensen &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">tjorge...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Internally standardizing (i.e., within each group separately) is problematic.  Suppose the pre-post difference is the same in both groups.  The group difference would be zero, and a standardized version of that effect (i.e., the group-by-time interaction) should also be zero.  But if group 1&#39;s SD.dif is smaller/larger than group 2&#39;s SD.dif, then the difference in (internally) standardized means would be nonzero.  Large differences in SD.dif between groups would make your effect appear large, even when there is no difference between groups.  </div><div><br></div><div>The only way standardization works is to use a common norm. So you should probably pool SD.dif as well.  Using the principle behind the method Mike described, you would need to allow for group sizes to differ when you calculate SD.dif_pooled (e.g., see the formula for pooled &quot;<i>s</i>&quot; under Cohen&#39;s <i>d</i>: <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Effect_size#Cohen&#39;s_d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Effect_size%23Cohen&#39;s_d&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792422446670000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2zkTu1aAU-b3EsSLvKUXKe\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Effect_size#Cohen&#39;s_d</a> )</div><div><br></div><div><div><div>Terrence D. Jorgensen</div><div>Assistant Professor, Methods and Statistics</div><div>Research Institute for Child Development and Education, the University of Amsterdam</div><div><a href=\"http://www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792422446670000&amp;usg=AOvVaw16CCWxmfX2wIdY6My-jjQ9\">http://www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen</a></div></div><div><br></div></div></div>\r\n\r\n<p></p></blockquote></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\">\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;lavaan&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">lavaan+un...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo view this discussion on the web visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/lavaan/1ac912de-f2e6-4222-8c06-4d0390aab9f5%40googlegroups.com?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=footer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/lavaan/1ac912de-f2e6-4222-8c06-4d0390aab9f5%2540googlegroups.com?utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_source%3Dfooter&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792422446671000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1QhN2nAaUQ0kOE0d2QXSUi\">https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/lavaan/1ac912de-f2e6-4222-8c06-4d0390aab9f5%40googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\n</blockquote></div><br clear=\"all\"><div><br></div>-- <br><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><font color=\"#274e13\"><b>Reza Norouzian</b></font></div><div dir=\"ltr\"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></d